Phase 0 Boundary Statement

BAS Test 0 is currently a locked, simplified falsification configuration for observing whether an HDPE drum can produce bounded repeated vertical buoyancy-state motion over an initial 6-inch stroke in 4 ft of water.

Simulation may prepare expectations and identify sensitive variables. It may not promote BAS beyond conceptual/plausible experimental status. Only recorded physical runs with preserved evidence can advance the evidence state.